@SurveyInterview.Server_HostAddress = http://localhost:5035

### Login (publik)
POST {{SurveyInterview.Server_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Daftar survey (publik)
GET {{SurveyInterview.Server_HostAddress}}/api/survey
Accept: application/json

### Detail survey (publik)
GET {{SurveyInterview.Server_HostAddress}}/api/survey/1
Accept: application/json

### Daftar responden (butuh token)
GET {{SurveyInterview.Server_HostAddress}}/api/survey/responses
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
